{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5MKocyvcDMJFtZqGDF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain, heavy door set deep in a stone frame. There is no handle. No hinges visible. Just a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at the center.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes cold air.*\n\n*You feel it watching you through that tiny opening — an eye of darkness looking back.*\n\n*Something on the other side shifts its weight.*\n\n**What do you insert?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":94,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}